#: ../../source/users/project/clean_project.rst:5
msgid "Clean project"
msgstr "清洁项目"

#: ../../source/users/project/clean_project.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech stores on the project database every `title block`_, "
"`conductor`_, `element`_, etc. which is introduced by the user. If the user "
"deletes one `element`_ or replace the `title block`_ from the `folio`_, the "
"`element`_ or `title block`_ will be deleted from the `folio`_ but it will "
"still be storage at the project database."
msgstr ""
"项目数据库中的 QElectroTech 存储 `图框 <title block_>`_，`导体 <conductor_>`_，`元件 "
"<element_>`_ 等，由用户引入。如果用户删除一个 `元件 <element_>`_ 或替换 `图框 <title block_>`_ 从 "
"`图幅 <folio_>`_，则 `元件 <element_>`_ 或 `图框 <title block_>`_ 将删除 `图幅 <folio_>`_ "
"但它仍将存储在项目数据库中。"

#: ../../source/users/project/clean_project.rst:12
msgid "QElectroTech allows cleaning the project database from `menu bar`_."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 清理项目数据库。"

#: ../../source/users/project/clean_project.rst:14
msgid ""
"Select **Project > Clean project** menu item to open the cleaning project "
"PopUP window."
msgstr "选择 **项目 > 清洁项目** 菜单项打开清洁项目 PopUP 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/project/clean_project.rst:19
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech cleaning project PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech清洁项目 PopUP 窗口"

#: ../../source/users/project/clean_project.rst:21
msgid "Select the check buttons desired (templates, elements, categories)."
msgstr "选择想要的检查按钮(templades, 元素，分类) 。"

#: ../../source/users/project/clean_project.rst:22
msgid ""
"Press the button **OK** to clean the `project`_ and close the cleaning "
"project PopUP window."
msgstr "按下按钮 **OK** 清理 `项目 <project_>`_ 并关闭 PopUP 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/project/clean_project.rst:27
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Project menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 项目菜单"

#: ../../source/users/project/clean_project.rst:31
msgid ""
"Cleaning the `project`_ is recommended to reduce the size of the project "
"file and increase the loading speed."
msgstr "建议清理 `项目 <project_>`_，以减少项目文件的大小，提高加载速度。"
